# Walkthrough - Search Functionality Fix

I have successfully connected the search bar to the tool list and cleaned up the project structure.

## Changes

### 1. Connected Search Logic
- **[src/pages/Index.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/tonos-tool-treasurebox/src/pages/Index.tsx)**: Added state to track the search query and filter tools dynamically.
- **[src/components/Header.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/tonos-tool-treasurebox/src/components/Header.tsx)**: Connected the search input to the main page state.

### 2. Enhanced Category Display
